Description: Open Cast Software Studio - voice transformation toolkit
 OCS Studio is a voice transformation toolkit that lets you change your
 voice to sound male, female, or like a character — live or on
 recordings — for voice acting, voice-over, streaming, or privacy.
 Includes VAD-gated pitch/formant shifting, gender conversion,
 AI-assisted hybrid re-voicing, transcript extraction & redaction,
 a virtual microphone for routing the anonymized voice to other apps,
 and a native Qt GUI.
